{"version":1,"content":"<p>伊朗國營傳媒周二報道，最高國家安全委員會秘書雷扎伊當天會見就任至今尚未公開露面的最高領袖穆傑塔巴，商討內容包括「透過維持控制霍爾木茲海峽和加強與周邊鄰國關係，以捍衛國家和地區安全」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:38.866612+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:15.489995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:29.879608+00:00","content_hash":"d8b62df6332de4da582aefbbc872201d20ff28fc5f1aa1e7dd98532ec4f98d76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}